### ============================================================
### 审单链路验证脚本 — IDEA HTTP Client 格式
### 用法：在 IDEA 中打开此文件，逐个点击绿色三角执行
### 前置条件：MySQL + Kafka 已启动，所有微服务已启动
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### 场景一：正常审单流程（下单 -> 审单通过 -> 验证各服务数据变化）
### ============================================================

### 0. 注册测试用户（如果已注册会返回业务错误，忽略即可）
POST http://localhost:8087/api/auth/register?username=auditor&password=123456&roleCode=DEALER

### 1. 登录获取 JWT Token
# 期望返回：code=200, data.accessToken 不为空
# 这一步的 token 会自动存到全局变量，后续请求自动带上
POST http://localhost:8087/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "auditor",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.log("Token: " + response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. 创建库存项（inventory-service）
# 期望返回：code=200, data.skuCode=SKU-001, data.totalQuantity=1000
POST http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "SKU-001",
  "skuName": "测试商品A",
  "unit": "BOX",
  "totalQuantity": 1000
}

### 3. 创建第二个库存项
POST http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "SKU-002",
  "skuName": "测试商品B",
  "unit": "BOX",
  "totalQuantity": 500
}

### 4. 查询客户信用额度（审单前基线）
# 期望返回：creditLimit=100000, creditUsed=0（如果是全新环境）
# 客户 cust-001 通过 docs/sql/customer.sql 初始化
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/cust-001/credit

> {%
    client.log("审单前 - 客户信用: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 5. 查询库存（审单前基线）
# 期望返回：totalQuantity=1000, lockedQuantity=0
GET http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/items/SKU-001

> {%
    client.log("审单前 - 库存: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 6. 下单（核心步骤）
# 期望返回：code=200, data.orderNo 不为空, data.status=TO_BE_CONFIRMED
# 下单时会同步调用 customer-service 占用信用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "skus": [
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-001",
      "skuName": "测试商品A",
      "quantity": 10,
      "price": 100.00
    },
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-002",
      "skuName": "测试商品B",
      "quantity": 5,
      "price": 200.00
    }
  ],
  "shippingFee": 50.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.data.orderId || response.body.data.orderNo);
    client.log("下单成功，订单号: " + client.global.get("orderId"));
%}

### 7. 查询订单详情
# 期望返回：status=TO_BE_CONFIRMED, totalAmount=1550(10*100+5*200+50运费)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.log("订单详情: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 8. 查询客户信用（下单后）
# 期望返回：creditUsed > 0（信用已被占用）
# 金额应为订单总额 = 10*100 + 5*200 + 50 = 1550
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/cust-001/credit

> {%
    client.log("下单后 - 客户信用: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
    client.assert(response.body.data.creditUsed > 0, "信用应该已被占用");
%}

### 9. 审单通过（核心步骤 — 触发五合一编排）
# 期望返回：code=200
# 这一步会同步调用：customer(信用校验) -> inventory(预占) -> marketing(重新计价) -> billing(生成账单) -> fulfillment(创建履约)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "approved": true,
  "operator": "auditor"
}

> {%
    client.log("审单通过");
%}

### 10. 查询订单（审单后）
# 期望返回：status=CONFIRMED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.log("审单后订单状态: " + response.body.data.status);
    client.assert(response.body.data.status === "CONFIRMED", "订单状态应为 CONFIRMED");
%}

### 11. 查询库存（审单后）
# 期望返回：lockedQuantity > 0（库存已被预占）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/items/SKU-001

> {%
    client.log("审单后 - 库存: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 12. 查询客户信用（审单后）
# 期望返回：creditUsed 仍 > 0（审单通过后信用占用不变）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/cust-001/credit

> {%
    client.log("审单后 - 客户信用: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 13. 手动创建账单（模拟审单时 billing 的结果）
# 注意：审单时 order-service 会通过 Feign 调 billing-service 创建账单
# 如果审单成功，这里可以直接查询账单。以下用于独立测试 billing-service
POST http://localhost:8082/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceOrderNo": "{{orderId}}",
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "lines": [
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-001",
      "skuName": "测试商品A",
      "quantity": 10,
      "price": 100.00
    },
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-002",
      "skuName": "测试商品B",
      "quantity": 5,
      "price": 200.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("billId", response.body.data.billId || response.body.data.id);
    client.log("账单ID: " + client.global.get("billId"));
%}

### 14. 查询账单
GET http://localhost:8082/api/bills/{{billId}}

> {%
    client.log("账单详情: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 15. 手动创建履约单（模拟审单时 fulfillment 的结果）
POST http://localhost:8085/api/fulfillments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceOrderNo": "{{orderId}}",
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "lines": [
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-001",
      "skuName": "测试商品A",
      "quantity": 10,
      "price": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("fulfillmentId", response.body.data.fulfillmentId || response.body.data.id);
    client.log("履约单ID: " + client.global.get("fulfillmentId"));
%}

### 16. 查询履约单
GET http://localhost:8085/api/fulfillments/{{fulfillmentId}}

> {%
    client.log("履约单详情: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 17. 履约发货
# 期望返回：code=200, 履约单状态变为 SHIPPED
POST http://localhost:8085/api/fulfillments/{{fulfillmentId}}/ship

> {%
    client.log("已发货");
%}

### 18. 履约签收
# 期望返回：code=200, 履约单状态变为 SIGNED
POST http://localhost:8085/api/fulfillments/{{fulfillmentId}}/sign

> {%
    client.log("已签收");
%}

### 19. 账单确认
POST http://localhost:8082/api/bills/{{billId}}/confirm

### 20. 账单结算
POST http://localhost:8082/api/bills/{{billId}}/settle

### 21. 账单核销
POST http://localhost:8082/api/bills/{{billId}}/verify

### 22. 账单状态回传订单
# 模拟 billing-service 回传订单状态
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/status-callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceOrderNo": "{{orderId}}",
  "billStatus": "CLOSED",
  "billId": "{{billId}}"
}


### ============================================================
### 场景二：审单拒绝流程（下单 -> 审单拒绝 -> 验证信用释放）
### ============================================================

### 23. 下第二单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "skus": [
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-001",
      "skuName": "测试商品A",
      "quantity": 3,
      "price": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId2", response.body.data.orderId || response.body.data.orderNo);
    client.log("第二单订单号: " + client.global.get("orderId2"));
%}

### 24. 审单拒绝
# 期望返回：code=200
# 审单拒绝会释放下单时占用的信用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId2}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId2}}",
  "approved": false,
  "reason": "客户信用不足，拒绝审单",
  "operator": "auditor"
}

> {%
    client.log("审单拒绝");
%}

### 25. 查询订单（拒绝后）
# 期望返回：status=REJECTED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.log("拒绝后订单状态: " + response.body.data.status);
    client.assert(response.body.data.status === "REJECTED", "订单状态应为 REJECTED");
%}

### 26. 查询客户信用（拒绝后）
# 期望返回：creditUsed 比下单后减少（信用已释放）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/cust-001/credit

> {%
    client.log("拒绝后 - 客户信用: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}


### ============================================================
### 场景三：取消订单流程（下单 -> 审单通过 -> 取消 -> 验证释放）
### ============================================================

### 27. 下第三单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "skus": [
    {
      "skuCode": "SKU-002",
      "skuName": "测试商品B",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 200.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId3", response.body.data.orderId || response.body.data.orderNo);
    client.log("第三单订单号: " + client.global.get("orderId3"));
%}

### 28. 审单通过
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId3}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId3}}",
  "approved": true,
  "operator": "auditor"
}

### 29. 取消订单
# 期望返回：code=200
# 取消会释放信用额度和库存预占
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId3}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.log("订单已取消");
%}

### 30. 查询订单（取消后）
# 期望返回：status=CANCELLED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.log("取消后订单状态: " + response.body.data.status);
    client.assert(response.body.data.status === "CANCELLED", "订单状态应为 CANCELLED");
%}

### 31. 查询库存（取消后）
# 期望返回：lockedQuantity 减少（库存已释放）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/items/SKU-002

> {%
    client.log("取消后 - 库存: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}


### ============================================================
### 场景四：库存推送流程（模拟上游系统推送库存数据）
### ============================================================

### 32. 推送上游库存（全量）
# 模拟外部库存系统推送数据到 inventory-push-service
# 期望返回：code=200, data 包含接收条数
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/inventory/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "INV_20260805_001",
  "pushType": "FULL",
  "timestamp": "2026-08-05T14:00:00+08:00",
  "totalCount": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "sourceSkuId": "SKU-001",
      "warehouseId": "WH-001",
      "ownerId": "OWNER_SELF",
      "inventory": {
        "totalQty": 2000,
        "availableQty": 1800,
        "lockedQty": 200,
        "inTransitQty": 100,
        "reservedQty": 50
      },
      "version": 1,
      "unit": "BOX",
      "unitConversion": 1
    },
    {
      "sourceSkuId": "SKU-002",
      "warehouseId": "WH-001",
      "ownerId": "OWNER_SELF",
      "inventory": {
        "totalQty": 800,
        "availableQty": 750,
        "lockedQty": 50,
        "inTransitQty": 0,
        "reservedQty": 0
      },
      "version": 1,
      "unit": "BOX",
      "unitConversion": 1
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.log("库存推送结果: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 33. 查询推送后的库存
GET http://localhost:8090/api/v1/inventory/query?skuId=SKU-001&warehouseId=WH-001

> {%
    client.log("推送后库存查询: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}


### ============================================================
### 场景五：金融结算流程（扣款 + 分账）
### ============================================================

### 34. 支付扣款（幂等）
# 模拟结算系统发起扣款
POST http://localhost:8091/api/v1/payment/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settlementId": "SET-001",
  "idempotencyKey": "SET-001_BATCH_1",
  "amount": 1550.00,
  "currency": "CNY",
  "paymentMethod": "WECHAT_PAY",
  "paymentToken": "mock_token_001",
  "description": "订单 {{orderId}} 结算扣款",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "userId": "cust-001"
}

> {%
    client.log("扣款结果: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 35. 分账执行
POST http://localhost:8091/api/v1/payment/split
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settlementId": "SET-001",
  "totalAmount": 1550.00,
  "splits": [
    {
      "recipientId": "MERCHANT-001",
      "recipientType": "MERCHANT",
      "amount": 1200.00,
      "description": "商家货款"
    },
    {
      "recipientId": "PLATFORM-001",
      "recipientType": "PLATFORM",
      "amount": 200.00,
      "description": "平台佣金"
    },
    {
      "recipientId": "LOGISTICS-001",
      "recipientType": "LOGISTICS",
      "amount": 150.00,
      "description": "物流费用"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.log("分账结果: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}

### 36. 重复扣款（验证幂等）
# 期望返回：code=200，但不重复扣款（幂等返回）
POST http://localhost:8091/api/v1/payment/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settlementId": "SET-001",
  "idempotencyKey": "SET-001_BATCH_1",
  "amount": 1550.00,
  "currency": "CNY",
  "paymentMethod": "WECHAT_PAY",
  "paymentToken": "mock_token_001",
  "description": "订单 {{orderId}} 结算扣款（重复）",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "userId": "cust-001"
}

> {%
    client.log("重复扣款结果（应幂等返回）: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.data));
%}
